    {
      "id": "claim_f919220e34a74fb3b3672695d90aca3f",
      "statement": "Prismarine table generation happens during preprocessing in load.py, before schema validation. The function preprocess_prismarine resolves conditional-tables, calls prisma_easysam.build_dynamo_tables for each table package, and merges generated tables into resources_data['tables']. Model-defined triggers are stripped unless the integration entry sets trigger: true.",
