      "id": "claim_94da1291ecc34be29b8c4c639c4631f8",
      "statement": "EasySAM validates three Prismarine constraints: the cluster prefix must start with the master prefix (prismarine.py), the default-base and each table base directory must exist (validate_schema.py), and table generation uses prisma_common.get_cluster + prisma_easysam.build_dynamo_tables with the Python path set via prisma_common.set_path.",
